he 2016 election  he's been very vocal about what the  Russians are doing in Europe he's been  very vocal about the fact that the  Russians continue to meddle in our  democracy  see to this very day so I would  encourage the intelligence community to  continue to tell the president what they  think and continue to speak publicly  about what they think and what they know  alright Michael Morell thanks so much  again for coming in for us today and  giving us your thoughts
 

